config TCPFS_FS
	tristate "TCP-backed BPF callback filesystem"
	depends on INET
	depends on BPF_SYSCALL
	depends on BPF_JIT
	help
	  tcpfs is an experimental read-only filesystem that delegates
	  protocol framing and result decoding to BPF struct_ops callbacks
	  and transports requests over TCP.

	  If unsure, say N.
